Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: apple: apple,t8010-aop: Add the T8015
 compass

The A11's AOP serves its magnetometer with its own report path; describe
it as apple,t8015-aop-compass.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dugs <dugahol@protonmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml
index 9cd793f..a7cee5d 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/apple/apple,t8010-aop.yaml
@@ -109,6 +109,7 @@ patternProperties:
           - apple,t8010-aop-gyro
           - apple,t8010-aop-compass
           - apple,t8010-aop-pressure
+          - apple,t8015-aop-compass
 
       mount-matrix:
         description: The sensor's mounting rotation in the device.
